SKF Group. [Official handbook PDF](https://www.skf.com/binaries/pub12/Images/0901d1968013be94-SKF-bearing-maintenance-handbook---10001_1-EN%281%29_tcm_12-463040.pdf). PUB SR/P7 10001/1 EN, September 2011, ISBN 978-91-978966-4-1, 454 PDF pages. Later PDF metadata does not change this edition.

Read chapters 1–11 progressively for bearing assemblies: basics, mounting, housings, seals, alignment, lubrication, inspection, troubleshooting, dismounting and damage. This maintenance handbook has a different purpose from the design catalogue.

Retrieved outside the repository on 30 October 2026. Publication details, contents and selected mounting, alignment and lubrication passages were inspected. Historical guidance needs the actual current equipment instructions and conditions when applied. Free publisher-hosted reading does not grant a general adaptation licence; publisher and image rights remain. The file stays external.

